.TH HMAP_PRINT_LIST 3
.SH NAME
hmap_print_list \- print all entries in the hash map
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include <hmap.h>
.P
.BI "int hmap_print_list(HMAP_DB* " hmap ");"
.SH DESCRIPTION
.BR hmap_print_list ()
traverses the hash map and prints all entries to standard output.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns HMAP_SUCCESS on success, or an error code.